	plugin	Generate a shareable Flutter project containing an API in Dart code with a platform-specific implementation through method channels for Android, iOS, Linux, macOS, Windows, web, or any combination of these
	plugin_ffi	(deprecated) Generate a shareable Flutter project containing an API in Dart code with a platform-specific implementation through dart:ffi for Android, iOS, Linux, macOS, Windows, or any combination of these
